label story_03_complete (The Living Night Complete)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): You found Dusk Forest. I can feel it breathing through you, dim and damp and alive.
"Dianthus Core": Darkness is not the Void, little alchemist. Night can shelter seeds. It can cool wounded roots. It can teach flowers to open without applause.
"Dianthus Core": But the forest is guarding something under its black water. Old roots bend there as if remembering a road they were told to forget.
"Dianthus Core": Go deeper into Blackwater Hollow. Bring back what blooms there, and I will listen through it for the path beneath Dusk.
[signal arg="quest_start:story_04_ruins"]
[end_timeline]
